<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - ICA started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ICA started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais started Mexican construction firm Empresas ICA SA with a buy rating, the brokerage said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Analyst Rafael Diaz said infrastructure spending in Mexico in the next four years should boost the company's revenues.</p>
<p>He said uncertainty over government plans to restructure toll road debt could weigh slightly on the stock in the short-term.</p>
<p>ICA was trading 10 centavos lower at 128.40 pesos in morning trade.</p>
<p>((--Daniel Perez Whitaker, Mexico City newsroom +528 345-7617))</p>
